{"version":1,"page":{"kind":"gloss-detail","href":"/shijing/gloss/037-mao-qiu/maoheng-zhushu-kr1c0004/0005-1","dataHref":"/__data/shijing/gloss/037-mao-qiu/maoheng-zhushu-kr1c0004/0005-1/data.json","title":"毛詩注疏 · 瑣兮尾兮，流離之子。叔兮伯兮，褎如充耳。 · 毛传 · 傳","description":"風 · 邶風 · 旄丘 · 《毛詩注疏》关于“瑣兮尾兮，流離之子。叔兮伯兮，褎如充耳。”的注脚：毛传释“瑣”为细，“尾”为末，“流離”为流散，“褎如充耳”为盛服而塞耳不闻。末章极写流亡者困苦与卫臣充耳不闻之冷漠，责意毕见。"},"payload":{"detail":{"route":{"poemId":"037-mao-qiu","materialId":"maoheng-zhushu-kr1c0004","glossId":"0005-1"},"href":"/shijing/gloss/037-mao-qiu/maoheng-zhushu-kr1c0004/0005-1","poem":{"id":"037-mao-qiu","title":"旄丘","categoryId":"feng","subcategoryId":"beifeng","path":["風","邶風","旄丘"],"segments":[{"id":"seg-001","text":"旄丘之葛兮","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-002","text":"何誕之節兮","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-003","text":"叔兮伯兮","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-004","text":"何多日也","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-005","text":"何其處也","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-006","text":"必有與也","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-007","text":"何其久也","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-008","text":"必有以也","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-009","text":"狐裘蒙戎","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-010","text":"匪車不東","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-011","text":"叔兮伯兮","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-012","text":"靡所與同","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-013","text":"瑣兮尾兮","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-014","text":"流離之子","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-015","text":"叔兮伯兮","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-016","text":"褎如充耳","isActive":true}]},"material":{"id":"maoheng-zhushu-kr1c0004","title":"毛詩注疏","authors":["毛亨","鄭氏","孔穎達"],"contributorLine":"漢唐 · 毛亨、鄭氏、孔穎達","era":"漢唐","publicationYear":653,"carrier":"TXT"},"annotation":{"id":"0005","order":5,"total":5,"layer":"span","layerLabel":"诗句片段","targetText":"瑣兮尾兮，流離之子。叔兮伯兮，褎如充耳。","targetNotes":"第4章毛傳撮要。","sourceLabel":null,"sourceNotes":"对应《毛詩正義/卷二》第4章。","notes":null,"glosses":[{"key":"0005-1","attributionLabel":"毛传","sectionLabel":"傳","text":"毛传释“瑣”为细，“尾”为末，“流離”为流散，“褎如充耳”为盛服而塞耳不闻。末章极写流亡者困苦与卫臣充耳不闻之冷漠，责意毕见。","notes":null}]},"siblings":[{"id":"000